╰─────────────────────║ Host reads the local users, groups and folder permissions. Changes run   ║─────────────────────╯
╭─ Last changes ──────║ through 'sudo qsysmin host ...' after a confirmation, are recorded in a  ║─────────────────────╮
│ 2026-10-28 12:00  us║ journal with the previous state, and can be undone. After a change to    ║                     │
│ 2026-10-27 10:30  us║ folder permissions, the containers it affects are watched. Activity      ║                     │
╰─────────────────────║ shows a log kept as a hash chain without a signature.                    ║─────────────────────╯
